
#Bad_End

NA: You swallow hard, unsure of what to say.
NA: The Viscount watches you for a long moment.
NA: His eyes are cold. Calculating.
@char VI.determined look:forward pos:{mid},0
VI: Tell me… under whose protection do you stand in Vila Rica?
NA: He repeats the question, heavier this time.
NA: It hangs in the air simple. Direct.
NA: But your mind suddenly feels empty.
PLAYER: I…
NA: You hesitate.
NA: No name comes to your lips. No protection. No ties.
NA: The silence stretches beyond what is acceptable.
NA: The Viscount tilts his head slightly.
@char VI.surprise look:forward pos:{mid},0
VI: No one?
NA: A faint smile touches his lips without warmth.
@char VI.determined look:forward pos:{mid},0
VI: Curious…
VI: A soul without patron… without declared home… without a name to sustain it.
NA: His gaze hardens.
VI: And yet, you move among people… of interest.
NA: He makes a subtle gesture with his hand. Two guards step toward you.
PLAYER: I just
VI: Yes, yes.
VI: I imagine you will claim mere curiosity.
NA: He takes a slow step forward.
VI: But in times such as these… curiosity tends to be costly.
NA: The guards are already at your side.
@char AL.determined look:right pos:{leftmid},0
AL: My Lord Viscount
NA: Alvarenga intervenes, stepping forward.
AL: I believe there has been a misunderstanding.
NA: Before he can continue, the metallic sound of blades partially drawn cuts through the air.
NA: The guards shift position a clear warning.
@char TIR.angryl look:left pos:{rightmid},0
TI: They are not
NA: Tiradentes tries to step forward.
NA: One of the guards raises his blade toward him.
GUARD: One more step, and I shall consider it an affront to the Crown, alferes.
NA: The movement forces him to stop.
NA: But his eyes remain fixed on you.
@char JOA.determined  look:right pos:{leftmid},0
JO: This is excessive…
NA: Joaquim speaks, clearly irritated.
JO: To arrest someone for not knowing how to answer
VI: For not being able to answer.
NA: The Viscount cuts him off without raising his voice.
VI: There is a difference.
NA: Silence settles once more.
VI: In the Crown’s lands, no one is no one by chance.
NA: A small gesture of his hand.
VI: Take them.
PLAYER: Wait
NA: A firm hand grabs your arm. Cold iron shackles snap around your wrist.

NA: The sound is sharp.
NA: Tiradentes takes an instinctive step forward. The guards advance again, he is forced to stop.
NA: But he does not look away from you.
NA: There is something in his eyes anger… and helplessness.
NA: Alvarenga’s expression hardens, clearly calculating how far he can go.
NA: Joaquim only watches, jaw tense.
NA: The Viscount… does not react.
NA: He simply observes.
NA: As if everything had already been decided long before the question.
NA: The square of Vila Rica continues to live around you.
NA: People pass. Conversations carry on.
NA: The world does not stop.
NA: But for you, everything changes.
NA: Now, you belong to another story…
NA: One that rarely ends well.
